{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>FairyScanner 是一款結合 OCR 文字辨識與語音朗讀的掃描工具，源於日常生活的實際需要：把書頁或圖片上大段文字，快速而準確地轉移到手機編輯，再以 AI 語音延伸閱讀。適合學生、上班族，以及經常需要整理紙本資料的人。原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費。</p>\n\n<h2>拍照辨識與語音朗讀</h2>\n<p>採用最新的 AI 文字與語音技術，拍攝頁面或圖片後即可即時辨識文字，辨識結果準確、可編輯，校對起來相當方便，亦能輕鬆轉換成語音。程式支援多種語言及發音，操作直覺，大約一分鐘就能上手；過程中沒有內嵌廣告，使用體驗較為舒適。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1125x2436bb-6.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1125x2436bb-7.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1125x2436bb-8.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1125x2436bb-9.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1125x2436bb-10.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：FairyScanner-OCR Scan &amp; Reader</li>\n<li>應用類別：Utilities</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-10T01:59:12.142124+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":319,"images":5,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}